'''Coastal Explorer Kanna''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] gacha event. She is an anti-[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]]/[[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien]] variant of [[Adventurer Kanna (Uber Rare Cat)|Adventurer Kanna]] that was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 714
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Coastal Explorer Kanna
|name2 = Deep-Diver Kanna
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Deep-Diver Kanna''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Deep-Diver Kanna is a specialized backliner that excels against her targeted traits (particularly Aliens) and is best used in stages featuring them as primary threats. If obtained during [[Into the Future]], Kanna will completely obliterate any and all Alien-based threats given some measure of proper meatshielding and having proper [[Treasure]]s, with the most notable enemy she counters being [[Ursamajor]]. She remains an exceptionally useful unit in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], serving as powerful burst damage against the otherwise tanky Starred Aliens (meaning it's smart to meatshield extra to keep enemies out of her blindspot). Unfortunately, CotC's restrictions limit her use in some stages where she would otherwise excel, but equally give her the spotlight in stages with Uber Rare or high-cost only restrictions. Like with Into the Future, Kanna's most crucial role in Cats of the Cosmos is her ability to counter the insanely buffed Ursamajors, which otherwise outrange and cripple the majority of traditional Alien counters such as [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat]], and have too much health and range for most generalist backliners to stop them before they push into your base.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Sniper}}

