==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], she could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event.
*Although Coastal Explorer Kanna doesn't have a [[True Form]] in game, within the game files there is a fully translated name and description.
**They are likely accidental leftovers from the localization process, as they appear to merely be untrimmed versions of her Evolved Form's description and name, on top of not being present in any other versions.
<pre>Great Deep-Diver Kanna
She explores the mighty Seven Seas in search of a legendary treasure!
However, she realizes that the true treasure is the abundance of life in the ocean.
Delivers massive damage to Floating and Aliens, and unleashes a Surge Attack.</pre>

